            "title": "Canadian neighbours",
            "body": "<p>We're in Canada, at first I thought these were a bit expensive with the exchange rate. So we tried them and then took a break for about six months and tried some other ones and right away realized that, these are exactly what my girls needed. So we're back and not leaving, only plan to transition from one age group up to the other.</p>",
